title: Audited border, diplomatic, media and social-policy chains

@border_person_2021
# scenario-ledger: BOR-03
# prose-audit: Grade A — A sick family turns abstract doctrine into an officer-level legality and welfare decision; every route records documentation, security confidence and human safety separately.
title: A person in the forest
subtitle: A patrol finds a sick family; training and documentation determine whether security and rescue can coexist
