= December 2021 — The order reaches one patrol

A Border Guard patrol finds two adults and a feverish child away from the
road. The unit can secure the location, summon medical aid, register an asylum
claim and preserve the encounter record. An unlawful transfer would hide the
family and place the officers under an order nobody wants to sign.

- @border_person_register
- @border_person_observe

@border_person_register
title: Demand rescue, registration and a signed chain of command
subtitle: Join individual welfare to officer legality without asking the opposition to command the patrol.
on-arrival: border_documentation += 9; border_officer_clarity += 5; refugee_empathy += 5; minority_safety += 5; border_security_confidence += 2; news_headline = "Lewica publishes a rescue-and-registration protocol for the forest encounter"

Lawyers and medics place the protocol before Parliament. The government still
commands the unit; it now has to own any different order in writing.

- @poland_events_2021_2023.router: Return to the historical events desk

