= January 2022 — Steel needs a doctrine

Construction can slow and redirect crossings, but it also concentrates people
at gates and makes rescue access depend on procedures. Parliament can demand
monitoring, procurement transparency and lawful access; it cannot direct a
construction unit from opposition.

- @barrier_safeguards
- @barrier_audit

