Video appears to show an officer striking a restrained man. In a separate
file, prosecutors accuse an aid activist of facilitating unlawful entry. The
state must disclose, preserve and test evidence in both cases; sympathy cannot
replace proof in either.

- @border_accountability_command
- @border_accountability_observe

