on-arrival: {!
Q.border_stage = 5;
Q.border_due_time = Number(Q.time) + 3;
Q.border_force_pressure += 15;
Q.border_security_confidence -= 3;
const deathThreshold = Math.max(0, Math.min(
    350,
    35 + Number(Q.border_force_pressure || 0) * 2 -
        Number(Q.border_documentation || 0) -
        Number(Q.border_officer_clarity || 0) * 0.5
));
Q.border_death_occurred = Number(Q.border_death_roll || 0) < deathThreshold ? 1 : 0;
Q.border_outcome = Q.border_death_occurred
    ? "A civilian dies after force by a Polish unit during Belarusian tactical escalation"
    : "Safeguards prevent fatal force during Belarusian tactical escalation";
Q.news_headline = Q.border_outcome;
!}

= [+ date_label +] — Escalation does not erase accountability

Belarusian units use lights, noise and coordinated groups to compress the
decision time of Polish patrols. [? if border_death_occurred: During one
encounter, Polish force causes a death. That fact was determined before the
response choices from the persisted risk roll and the prior safeguards.?][? if
not border_death_occurred: An officer interrupts an unsafe order and medical
aid reaches the scene. Crossing pressure remains; safeguards changed the
outcome rather than preventing the escalation.?]

