= [+ date_label +] — A local queue becomes a national lie

A school and clinic face real capacity pressure after new arrivals. A hostile
outlet adds a fabricated claim that a veteran was denied treatment to favour a
newcomer. One Lewica candidate repeats it before checking. Veterans, medics,
residents and aid organisers can either be split into television roles or
write the service record together.

- @border_joint_mobilisation
